{"id":"g2252","title":"Lotio Pruni comp./Quarz 1%","description":"Anthroposophisches Arzneimittel zur äußeren Anwendung bei Herpes zoster mit brennenden, neuropathischen Schmerzen. Wirkt unmittelbar schmerzlindernd.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Ähnlich: "},{"type":"inline","id":"11759","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Lotio Pruni comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA NL (früher "},{"type":"inline","id":"11760","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hauttonikum"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA DE) enthält die gleichen pflanzlichen Bestandteile, jedoch kein Quarz, "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0324.html","id":"11761","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Venadoron®"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA DE enthält Kupfersulfat statt Quarz. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WELEDA NL. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Arnica, Planta tota Ø; Citrus medica, Succus; Hamamelis, Cortex et Folium; Iris germanica, Rhizoma Ø; Lappa major, Radix Ø; Natrii silicates solutio; Oleum aethereum Citri; Oleum aethereum Litseae cubebae; Prunus spinosa, Fructus et Summitates Ø; Quarz. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Herpes zoster "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1896","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Mit brennenden, neuropathischen Schmerzen. "}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 x tgl. lokal auftragen, ggf. öfters. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Unmittelbare Schmerzlinderung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 2 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Keine, selbst beim Einbringen in offene Wunden. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g1798.html","id":"11762","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Aconitum comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA 3 x tgl. 10 Glob. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": CZ. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Hautbehandlung bei Strahlentherapie, Vorbeugung der Strahlendermatitis "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a2267","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Direkt nach der Bestrahlung sowie vor dem Zubettgehen auftragen, jedoch "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","text":"nicht"}]},{"type":"text","text":" vor der Bestrahlung und auch nicht, wenn die Haut mazeriert ist. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Die Haut bleibt vital und intakt, allenfalls mit milder Rötung ohne wesentliche Entzündung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Während der Bestrahlung und gewöhnlich 4 Wo. darüber hinaus bzw. so lange, wie die Haut nach Bestrahlungsende Zeichen der Irritation aufweist. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bei korrekter Anwendung keine. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Misteltherapie bezüglich der zugrundeliegenden Erkrankung. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Sonstiges"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Siehe auch Grundlagen und Anwendung der Misteltherapie, "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/m08.html#m08-01","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Kapitel 8.1. Begleitung von Strahlentherapie und Behandlung von Nebenwirkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":" im Band 2. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Die ursprüngliche Einsendung bezog sich auf Hauttonikum WELEDA, das nicht mehr erhältlich ist. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": JL. "}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}